# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Uploaded user content (category covers, video thumbnails, project photos).
# These are runtime data, not source — in Docker they live in the `uploads`
# volume. Remove this block if you want the seeded cover images committed.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
WebSyteProffessor/src/WebSyteProffessor/wwwroot/uploads/


